          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Skincare built on evidence, not trends",
            "heading_size": "hxl"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>C-Aesthetics was founded on a simple idea: skincare should be judged by results, not packaging. We work with dermatologists and formulation chemists to build routines that address real skin concerns \u2014 hydration, barrier repair, visible aging, and sensitivity \u2014 using ingredients at concentrations that are actually effective.</p>"
          }
        }
